(1168307, 1168307, 'PK', 'Pasrur', 'Pasrur', 'Pasrur', 'pasrur', 'Punjab', null, 32.26286, 74.66327, 102717, false, null, 'Pasrur is a historical city of Sialkot District in the Punjab province of Pakistan. It is the capital of Pasrur Tehsil and is administratively subdivided into 26 wards of the municipal committee Pasrur.'),
