(1176734, 1176734, 'PK', 'Haydarabad', 'Hyderabad', 'Hyderabad', 'haydarabad|hyderabad', 'Sindh', null, 25.39689, 68.37718, 1921275, false, 'Haydarabad, Pakistan''ın Sind Eyaleti''nde bir şehir.', 'Hyderabad, also known as Neroonkot, is the capital and largest city of the Hyderabad Division in the Sindh province of Pakistan.'),
