(1266049, 1266049, 'IN', 'Kota', 'Kota', 'Kota', 'kota', 'Rajasthan', null, 25.18254, 75.83907, 1001694, false, 'Kota, Hindistan''ın Racastan eyaletinde bulunan bir şehirdir. Şehrin nüfusu 2011 sayımına göre 1.001.694''tür.', 'Kota, previously known as Kotah, is the third-largest city of the Indian state of Rajasthan. It is located about 230 km south of the state capital, Jaipur, on the banks of the Chambal River.'),
