(1267995, 1267995, 'IN', 'Kanpur', 'Kanpur', 'Kanpur', 'kanpur', 'Uttar Pradesh', null, 26.46523, 80.34975, 2823249, false, 'Kanpur Hindistan''ın Uttar Pradeş eyâletinde Allahabad''den sonra ikinci büyük şehridir. 2011 yılı verilerine göre 2,7 milyon nüfusu vardır.', 'Kanpur, formerly anglicized as Cawnpore, is a large city in the Indian state of Uttar Pradesh. Founded by Rajput ruler Hindu Singh Chandel, Kanpur became one of the most important commercial and military stations of British Raj.'),
