(1567621, 1567621, 'VN', 'Sơn Tây', 'Sơn Tây', 'Son Tay', 'son tay', 'Hanoi', null, 21.14053, 105.50686, 230577, false, null, 'Sơn Tây is a former district-level town of Hanoi, the capital of Vietnam.'),
(1567681, 1567681, 'VN', 'Son La', 'Sơn La', 'Son La', 'son la', 'Sơn La Province', null, 21.3256, 103.91882, 106052, false, 'Sơn La, Vietnam''ın Sơn La ilinin merkezi olan şehirdir. Şehir, ülkenin Kuzeybatı Bölgesi''nde yer almaktadır.', 'Sơn La is a former city in the north-west region of Vietnam. It is the capital of Sơn La Province.'),
(1567788, 1567788, 'VN', 'Soc Trang', 'Sóc Trăng', 'Soc Trang', 'soc trang', 'Can Tho City', null, 9.59995, 105.97193, 221430, false, 'Sóc Trăng, Vietnam''ın Sóc Trăng ilinin merkezi olan şehirdir. Şehir, ülkenin güneyinde Mekong Deltası''nda Cầu Quay Nehri''nin kıyısında yer almaktadır.', 'Sóc Trăng is a former provincial city and capital of the former Sóc Trăng province, Vietnam. It was upgraded from a town to a city following decree 22/2007/NĐ-CP on 8 February 2007.'),
