(1586443, 1586443, 'VN', 'Ca Mau', 'Cà Mau', 'Ca Mau', 'ca mau', 'Ca Mau', null, 9.17682, 105.15242, 226372, false, 'Cà Mau, Vietnam''ın Cà Mau ilinin merkezi olan şehirdir. Şehir, Mekong Deltası''nda Gành Hào Nehri''nin kıyısında yer almaktadır.', 'Cà Mau is a former provincial city in southern Vietnam. It was the capital of Cà Mau province, a province in the Mekong Delta region, in the southernmost part of Vietnam''s inland territory.'),
