(1630634, 1630634, 'ID', 'Probolinggo', 'Probolinggo', 'Probolinggo', 'probolinggo', 'East Java', null, -7.7543, 113.2159, 243746, false, null, 'Probolinggo is a city on the north coast of East Java province, Indonesia. It covers an area of 55.197 sq. km, and had a population of 217,062 at the 2010 census and 239,649 at the 2020 census; the official estimate as at mid 2025 was 244,849.'),
(1630789, 1630789, 'ID', 'Pontianak', 'Pontianak', 'Pontianak', 'pontianak', 'West Kalimantan', null, -0.03194, 109.325, 686019, false, 'Pontianak, Endonezya''nın Borneo''daki Batı Kalimantan ilinin başkenti olan şehirdir. Bu şehir 23 Ekim 1771 tarihinde kurulmuştur.', 'Pontianak, also known as Khuntien or 坤甸 in Teochew and Hakka, is the capital of the Indonesian province of West Kalimantan, founded first as a trading port on the island of Borneo, occupying an area of 118.21 km2 in the delta of the Kapuas River, at a point where it is joined by its major tributary, the Landak River.'),
