(1639850, 1639850, 'ID', 'Klungkung', 'Klungkung', 'Klungkung', 'klungkung', 'Bali', null, -8.53333, 115.4, 223720, false, null, 'Klungkung Regency is the smallest regency in the province of Bali, Indonesia. It has an area of 315 km2 and had a population at the 2024 census of 223,720.'),
