(1641134, 1641134, 'ID', 'Karawang', 'Karawang', 'Karawang', 'karawang', 'West Java', null, -6.30525, 107.3197, 307880, false, null, 'Karawang is the capital of the Karawang Regency of West Java, Indonesia. It is 32 miles east of Jakarta, and had a population of 307,880 at the 2020 Census, spread over two districts of the regency - West Karawang and East Karawang.'),
