(1643837, 1643837, 'ID', 'Gorontalo', 'Gorontalo', 'Gorontalo', 'gorontalo', 'Gorontalo', null, 0.5375, 123.0625, 205390, false, 'Gorontalo, Endonezya''nın Gorontalo ilinin merkezi olan şehirdir. Yüzölçümü 64.79 km² olan şehrin nüfusu 2010 yılı itibarı ile 179,991''dir.', 'Gorontalo is a city and the capital of the Gorontalo Province, Sulawesi, Indonesia. The city has a land area of 70.9 km2 and had a population of 179,991 at the 2010 census and 198,539 at the 2020 census; the official estimate as at mid 2025 was 204,805.'),
