(1646170, 1646170, 'ID', 'Cirebon', 'Cirebon', 'Cirebon', 'cirebon', 'West Java', null, -6.7063, 108.557, 344851, false, 'Cirebon kenti Batı Cava Eyaleti, Endonezya şehirlerinden biridir.', 'Cirebon is a port city on the northern coast of the Indonesian island of Java. It is the only coastal city of West Java, located about 40 km west of the provincial border with Central Java, approximately 297 km east of Jakarta, at 6°43′S 108°34′E.'),
