(1647149, 1647149, 'ID', 'Ciamis', 'Ciamis', 'Ciamis', 'ciamis', 'West Java', null, -7.3257, 108.3534, 109839, false, null, 'Ciamis is a district and a town; it is the regency seat of Ciamis Regency in West Java, Indonesia. It covers an area of 33.80 square kilometres.'),
