(1671566, 1671566, 'TW', 'Nantou', 'Nantou City', 'Nantou', 'nantou|nantou city', 'Taiwan', null, 23.91566, 120.66387, 105682, false, 'Nantou, Tayvan''ın Nantou ilçesinin merkezi olan şehirdir. Şehir, ülkenin orta batısında Bagua Dapları ve Maoluo Nehri arasında yer almaktadır.', 'Nantou City is a county-administered city located in the northwest of Nantou County, Taiwan. It lies between the Bagua Mountains and the Maoluo River and is the county seat of Nantou County.'),
(1673816, 1673816, 'TW', 'Fongshan District', 'Fongshan District', 'Fengshan', 'fongshan district|fengshan', 'Takao', null, 22.62659, 120.36126, 356463, false, null, 'Fongshan District is a district located in southern Kaohsiung, Taiwan. Fongshan is one of the administrative centers of Kaohsiung and is home to the Republic of China Military Academy.'),
(1673820, 1673820, 'TW', 'Kaohsiung', 'Kaohsiung', 'Kaohsiung', 'kaohsiung', 'Takao', null, 22.61626, 120.31333, 2737660, false, 'Kaohsiung, Tayvan''ın özel şehirlerinden biri ve ikinci büyük şehridir. Şehir ülkenin güneybatısında Tayvan Boğazı''nın kıyısında yer almaktadır.', 'Kaohsiung, officially Kaohsiung City, is a special municipality located in southern Taiwan. With a population of approximately 2.7 million people, it is Taiwan''s third most populous city and the largest city in southern Taiwan.'),
(1675151, 1675151, 'TW', 'Hsinchu', 'Hsinchu City', 'Hsinchu', 'hsinchu|hsinchu city', 'Taiwan', null, 24.80361, 120.96861, 453536, false, 'Hsinchu, Tayvan''ın il şehirlerinden biridir. Şehir ülkenin kuzeybatısında yer almaktadır.', 'Hsinchu, officially Hsinchu City, is a city located in northwestern Taiwan. It is the most populous city in Taiwan that is not a special municipality, with estimated 476,273 inhabitants.'),
(1675393, 1675393, 'TW', 'Xizhi District', 'Xizhi District', 'Xizhi', 'xizhi district|xizhi', 'Taipei', null, 25.06615, 121.65985, 204619, false, null, 'Xizhi is an inner city district in eastern New Taipei City in northern Taiwan, and is located between Taipei City and Keelung City.'),
