(1732750, 1732750, 'MY', 'Masai', 'Masai', 'Masai', 'masai', 'Johor', null, 1.4907, 103.8788, 141730, false, null, 'Masai is an area in Pasir Gudang, Johor Bahru District, Johor, Malaysia, and is the oldest neighbourhood of the city of Johor Bahru.'),
(1732752, 1732752, 'MY', 'Johor Bahru', 'Johor Bahru', 'Johor Bahru', 'johor bahru', 'Johor', null, 1.4655, 103.7578, 858118, false, 'Johor Bahru, Malezya''nın Johor eyaletinin başkentidir. Şehir Malay Yarımadası''nın güney ucunda, Johor Boğazı''nın kuzey kıyısında ve Singapur''a yürüme mesafesinde yer almakta olup bu konumu sayesinde ülkenin dışarıya açılan kapısı konumundadır.', 'Johor Bahru is the capital city of the Malaysian state of Johor. It is the core city of Johor Bahru District, Malaysia''s second-largest district by population and economy.'),
(1732811, 1732811, 'MY', 'Kluang', 'Kluang', 'Kluang', 'kluang', 'Johor', null, 2.03046, 103.31689, 323762, false, null, 'Kluang, formerly spelled Keluang, is a town and the district capital of Kluang District, Johor, Malaysia. Founded in 1915 by the British as the administrative capital for central Johor, Kluang is situated in the central geographical core of the state and lies within a 90-minute drive of major urban hubs across Johor.'),
(1732869, 1732869, 'MY', 'Muar', 'Muar', 'Muar', 'muar', 'Johor', null, 2.0442, 102.5689, 314776, false, null, 'Muar, officially known by the sobriquet Bandar Maharani, is a historical town and the capital of Muar District, Johor, Malaysia, situated by the estuary of the eponymous Muar River.'),
(1732901, 1732901, 'MY', 'Kapar', 'Kapar', 'Kapar', 'kapar', 'Selangor', null, 3.13333, 101.38333, 269627, false, null, 'Kapar is a town in Klang District, Selangor, Malaysia. It is 17 km from Klang city via federal route 5.'),
(1732903, 1732903, 'MY', 'Shah Alam', 'Shah Alam', 'Shah Alam', 'shah alam', 'Selangor', null, 3.08507, 101.53281, 740750, false, 'Şah Alem, Malezya''nın Selangor eyaletinin başkentidir. Şehir başkent Kuala Lumpur''un 25 kilometre batısında yer almaktadır.', 'Shah Alam is a city and the state capital of Selangor, Malaysia which is situated within the Petaling District and a small portion of the neighbouring Klang District.'),
(1732905, 1732905, 'MY', 'Klang', 'Klang', 'Klang', 'klang', 'Selangor', null, 3.03667, 101.44333, 240016, false, 'Klang, Malezya''nın Selangor eyaletinde bulunan bir şehirdir. Şehir Klang Vadisi''nde başkent Kuala Lumpur''un 32 km batısında yer almaktadır.', 'Klang or Kelang, officially the Royal City of Klang, is a city and the royal capital of the state of Selangor, Malaysia.'),
(1733432, 1733432, 'MY', 'Kota Kinabalu', 'Kota Kinabalu', 'Kota Kinabalu', 'kota kinabalu', 'Sabah', null, 5.9749, 116.0724, 500421, false, 'Kota Kinabalu, Malezya''nın Sabah eyaletinin başkentidir. Şehir, Borneo''nun kuzeybatı sahilinde Güney Çin Denizi''ne bakan kısmında yer almaktadır.', 'Kota Kinabalu, colloquially referred to as KK, is the state capital of Sabah, Malaysia. It is also the capital of the Kota Kinabalu District as well as the West Coast Division of Sabah.'),
(1733953, 1733953, 'MY', 'Lahad Datu', 'Lahad Datu', 'Lahad Datu', 'lahad datu', 'Sabah', null, 5.02298, 118.32897, 105622, false, 'Lahad Datu, Malezya''nın Sabah eyaletinde bulunan bir şehirdir. Şehir Borneo Adası''nın kuzeydoğusunda Darvel Körfezi''nin kuzey kıyısında yer almaktadır.', 'Lahad Datu is the capital of the Lahad Datu District in the Dent Peninsula on Tawau Division of Sabah, Malaysia.'),
(1734052, 1734052, 'MY', 'Sandakan', 'Sandakan', 'Sandakan', 'sandakan', 'Sabah', null, 5.8402, 118.1179, 439050, false, 'Sandakan, Malezya''nın Sabah eyaletinde bulunan bir şehirdir. Şehir Borneo Adası''nın kuzeydoğusunda Sulu Denizi kıyısında yer almaktadır.', 'Sandakan formerly known at various times as Elopura, is the capital of the Sandakan District in Sabah, Malaysia.'),
(1734199, 1734199, 'MY', 'Tawau', 'Tawau', 'Tawau', 'tawau', 'Sabah', null, 4.24482, 117.89115, 372615, false, 'Tawau, Malezya''nın Sabah eyaletinde bulunan bir şehirdir. Şehir Borneo Adası''nın kuzeydoğusunda Celebes Denizi kıyısında yer almaktadır.', 'Tawau is the capital of the Tawau District in Sabah, Malaysia. It is the third-largest city in Sabah, after Kota Kinabalu and Sandakan.'),
(1734393, 1734393, 'MY', 'Kulim', 'Kulim', 'Kulim', 'kulim', 'Kedah', null, 5.36499, 100.56177, 170889, false, null, 'The Kulim District is a district and town in the state of Kedah, Malaysia. It is located on the southeast of Kedah, bordering Penang.'),
(1734586, 1734586, 'MY', 'Taiping', 'Taiping', 'Taiping', 'taiping', 'Perak', null, 4.85, 100.73333, 217647, false, null, 'Taiping is a city located in Larut, Matang and Selama District, in the state of Perak, Malaysia. It is located approximately 48 km northwest of Ipoh, the capital of Perak, and 78 km southeast of George Town, Penang.'),
(1734634, 1734634, 'MY', 'Ipoh', 'Ipoh', 'Ipoh', 'ipoh', 'Perak', null, 4.5841, 101.0829, 759952, false, 'Ipoh, Malezya''nın Perak eyaletinin başkentidir. Şehir başkent Kuala Lumpur''un yaklaşık 200 km kuzeyinde North-South Otoyolu''nun üzerinde yer almaktadır.', 'Ipoh is the capital city of the Malaysian state of Perak. Located on the Kinta River, it is nearly 200 km north of Kuala Lumpur and 150 km southeast of George Town in neighbouring Penang.'),
(1734705, 1734705, 'MY', 'Kuala Terengganu', 'Kuala Terengganu', 'Kuala Terengganu', 'kuala terengganu', 'Terengganu', null, 5.3302, 103.1408, 426500, false, 'Kuala Terengganu, Malezya''nın Terengganu eyaletinin başkentidir. Şehir başkent Kuala Lumpur''un 440 km kuzeydoğusunda Güney Çin Denizi kıyısında yer almaktadır.', 'Kuala Terengganu, colloquially referred to as KT, is the administrative, economic and royal city of the state of Terengganu, Malaysia.'),
(1734759, 1734759, 'MY', 'Malakka', 'Malacca', 'Malacca', 'malakka|malacca', 'Melaka', null, 2.196, 102.2405, 579000, false, 'Malakka, Malezya''nın Malakka eyaleti eyaletinin başkentidir. Şehir adını aldığı Malakka Boğazı''nın kıyısında yer almaktadır.', 'Malacca City is the capital city of the Malaysian state of Malacca. It is the oldest Malaysian city on the Strait of Malacca, having become a successful entrepôt in the era of the Malacca Sultanate.'),
(1734810, 1734810, 'MY', 'Seremban', 'Seremban', 'Seremban', 'seremban', 'Negeri Sembilan', null, 2.7297, 101.9381, 372917, false, 'Seremban, Malezya''nın Negeri Sembilan eyaletinin başkentidir. Yüzölçümü 959 km² olan şehrin nüfusu 2010 yılı itibarı ile 555,935''tir.', 'Seremban is a city in the Seremban District and the capital of the state of Negeri Sembilan in Peninsular Malaysia.'),
(1734815, 1734815, 'MY', 'Port Dickson', 'Port Dickson', 'Port Dickson', 'port dickson', 'Negeri Sembilan', null, 2.52462, 101.79651, 119300, false, null, 'Port Dickson, colloquially referred to as PD, is a beach resort in Port Dickson District, Negeri Sembilan, Malaysia.'),
(1734821, 1734821, 'MY', 'Sepang', 'Sepang', 'Sepang', 'sepang', 'Selangor', null, 2.6931, 101.7498, 212050, false, null, null),
(1735076, 1735076, 'MY', 'Butterworth', 'Butterworth', 'Butterworth', 'butterworth', 'Penang', null, 5.3991, 100.36382, 107591, false, null, 'Butterworth is the city centre of Seberang Perai in the Malaysian state of Penang. It lies about 3 km east of George Town, the capital city of Penang, across the Penang Strait.'),
(1735079, 1735079, 'MY', 'Bukit Mertarajam', 'Bukit Mertajam', 'Bukit Mertajam', 'bukit mertarajam|bukit mertajam', 'Penang', null, 5.36301, 100.4667, 212329, false, null, 'Bukit Mertajam is a suburb of Seberang Perai in the Malaysian state of Penang. It also serves as the seat of the Central Seberang Perai District.'),
(1735093, 1735093, 'MY', 'Tasek Gelugor', 'Tasek Gelugor', 'Tasek Glugor', 'tasek gelugor|tasek glugor', 'Penang', null, 5.48032, 100.49849, 135786, false, null, 'Tasek Gelugor is a suburb of Seberang Perai in the Malaysian state of Penang. Within its vicinity it is the town closest to the North–South Expressway.'),
(1735102, 1735102, 'MY', 'Bayan Lepas', 'Bayan Lepas', 'Bayan Lepas', 'bayan lepas', 'Penang', null, 5.29992, 100.26052, 130455, false, null, 'Bayan Lepas is a suburb of George Town in the Malaysian state of Penang.'),
(1735106, 1735106, 'MY', 'George Town', 'George Town', 'George Town', 'george town', 'Penang', null, 5.41123, 100.33543, 158336, false, 'George Town, Malezya''nın Penang eyaletinin başkentidir. Şehir Penang Adası''nın kuzey doğusunda yer almaktadır.', 'George Town is the capital of the Malaysian state of Penang. It is the core city of the George Town Conurbation, Malaysia''s second largest metropolitan area with a population of 2.84 million and the second largest metropolitan economy in the country.'),
(1735150, 1735150, 'MY', 'Rawang', 'Rawang', 'Rawang', 'rawang', 'Selangor', null, 3.3213, 101.5767, 199095, false, null, 'Rawang is a town in the Gombak District of Selangor, Malaysia, located about 25 km northwest of Kuala Lumpur. It began as a tin mining town and has grown into a significant urban area within Greater Kuala Lumpur.'),
(1735153, 1735153, 'MY', 'Sungai Buloh', 'Sungai Buloh', 'Sungai Buloh', 'sungai buloh', 'Selangor', null, 3.21, 101.561, 222858, false, 'Sungai Buloh ya da Sungei Buloh, Malezya’nın Selangor eyaletinde, Petaling Bölgesi’nin kuzeyinde bir kasaba, bir mukim ve bir parlamento seçim bölgesidir.', 'Sungai Buloh, or Sungei Buloh, is a town, a mukim and a parliamentary constituency in the northern part of Petaling District, Selangor, Malaysia.'),
(1735158, 1735158, 'MY', 'Petaling Jaya', 'Petaling Jaya', 'Petaling Jaya', 'petaling jaya', 'Selangor', null, 3.10726, 101.60671, 807879, false, 'Petaling Jaya, Malezya''nın Selangor eyaletinde bulunan bir şehirdir. Şehir, Kuala Lumpur''un bir uydu kenti olarak kurulmuştur.', 'Petaling Jaya, colloquially referred to as "PJ", is a city in Petaling District, in the state of Selangor, Malaysia.'),
(1735161, 1735161, 'MY', 'Kuala Lumpur', 'Kuala Lumpur', 'Kuala Lumpur', 'kuala lumpur', 'Kuala Lumpur', null, 3.1412, 101.68653, 1453975, true, 'Kuala Lumpur resmî adıyla Kuala Lumpur Federal Bölgesi, Malezya''nın başkenti ve federal bir bölgesidir. 2024 yılı itibarıyla 2.075.600 nüfusuyla 243 km² alanı kapsayan, ülkenin en kalabalık şehridir.', 'Kuala Lumpur, officially the Federal Territory of Kuala Lumpur, is the capital city and a federal territory of Malaysia.'),
(1735162, 1735162, 'MY', 'Setapak', 'Setapak', 'Setapak', 'setapak', 'Selangor', null, 3.207, 101.727, 353268, false, null, 'Setapak is a town and mukim straddling both northeastern Kuala Lumpur and Gombak District of Selangor, Malaysia.'),
(1735166, 1735166, 'MY', 'Batu Mağaraları', 'Batu Caves', 'Batu Caves', 'batu magaralari|batu caves', 'Selangor', null, 3.238, 101.682, 254083, false, 'Batu Mağaraları, Malezya''da bir dizi mağara ve mağara tapınağına sahip bir mogotedir. Adını Malayca "rock" anlamına gelen batu kelimesinden alır.', 'Batu Caves are a series of limestone caves in Gombak, Selangor, Malaysia. It is located on a 325 m–tall mogote, about 13 km north of the Malaysian capital of Kuala Lumpur.'),
(1735168, 1735168, 'MY', 'Ampang', 'Ampang', 'Ampang', 'ampang', 'Kuala Lumpur', null, 3.15, 101.76667, 126285, false, null, null),
(1735227, 1735227, 'MY', 'Kuantan', 'Kuantan', 'Kuantan', 'kuantan', 'Pahang', null, 3.8077, 103.326, 548014, false, 'Kuantan, Malezya''nın Pahang eyaletinin başkentidir. Şehir Kuantan Nehri''nin ağzında Güney Çin Denizi kıyısında yer almaktadır.', 'Kuantan is a city and the state capital of Pahang, Malaysia. It is located near the mouth of the Kuantan River.'),
(1735453, 1735453, 'MY', 'Sitiawan', 'Sitiawan', 'Sitiawan', 'sitiawan', 'Perak', null, 4.2168, 100.6996, 156234, false, null, null),
(1735459, 1735459, 'MY', 'Teluk Intan', 'Teluk Intan', 'Teluk Intan', 'teluk intan', 'Perak', null, 4.02219, 101.02083, 232800, false, null, 'Teluk Intan is a town in Hilir Perak District, Perak, Malaysia. It is the district capital, the largest town in the district and fourth largest town in the state of Perak with an estimated population of around 172,505, more than half of Hilir Perak district''s total population.'),
(1735498, 1735498, 'MY', 'Sungai Petani', 'Sungai Petani', 'Sungai Petani', 'sungai petani', 'Kedah', null, 5.647, 100.48772, 544851, false, null, 'Sungai Petani is a town in Kuala Muda District, Kedah, Malaysia. The population of the municipal area of Sungai Petani is larger than Kedah''s state capital, Alor Setar.'),
(1735545, 1735545, 'MY', 'Pasir Puteh', 'Pasir Puteh', 'Pasir Puteh', 'pasir puteh', 'Kelantan', null, 5.83333, 102.4, 137400, false, null, null),
(1735572, 1735572, 'MY', 'Kuala Krai', 'Kuala Krai', 'Kuala Krai', 'kuala krai', 'Kelantan', null, 5.5313, 102.19925, 105007, false, null, 'Kuala Krai is a town located in the coterminous Kuala Krai District in southern-central Kelantan, Malaysia. During British protection it was known as Kuala Lebir.'),
(1735634, 1735634, 'MY', 'Kuching', 'Kuching', 'Kuching', 'kuching', 'Sarawak', null, 1.55, 110.33333, 402738, false, 'Kuching, Sarawak eyaletinin başkentidir. Şehir Doğu Malezya''da Borneo Adası''nın kuzeybatısındadır.', 'Kuching, officially the City of Kuching, is the capital and the most populous city in the state of Sarawak in Malaysia.'),
(1735902, 1735902, 'MY', 'Sibu', 'Sibu', 'Sibu', 'sibu', 'Sarawak', null, 2.3, 111.81667, 198239, false, 'Sibu, Malezya''nin Sarawak eyaletinde yer alan ve Sibu ilçesinde yer alan bir şehirdir. Şehrin toplam nüfusu 162.676''dır.', 'Sibu is a city located in the central region of Sarawak, Malaysia. It serves as the capital of Sibu District within Sibu Division and is situated on the island of Borneo.'),
(1736309, 1736309, 'MY', 'Alor Setar', 'Alor Setar', 'Alor Setar', 'alor setar', 'Kedah', null, 6.12104, 100.36014, 417800, false, 'Alor Setar, Malezya''nın Kedah eyaletinin başkenti ve ikinci büyük şehridir. Şehir Batı Malezya''nın doğu sahilinde başkent Kuala Lumpur''un 400 km uzakta yer almaktadır.', 'Alor Setar, known as Alor Star from 2003 to 2009, is the state capital of Kedah, Malaysia. It is the second-largest city in the state, after Sungai Petani, and one of the most important cities on the west coast of Peninsular Malaysia.'),
(1736372, 1736372, 'MY', 'Pasir Mas', 'Pasir Mas', 'Pasir Mas', 'pasir mas', 'Kelantan', null, 6.04934, 102.13987, 230424, false, null, 'Pasir Mas is a town in Pasir Mas District, in north-western Kelantan, Malaysia.'),
(1736376, 1736376, 'MY', 'Kota Bharu', 'Kota Bharu', 'Kota Bharu', 'kota bharu', 'Kelantan', null, 6.12361, 102.24333, 568900, false, 'Kota Bharu, Malezya''nın Kelantan eyaletinin başkentidir. Adı "yeni şehir" veya "yeni kale" anlamına gelen şehir; Batı Malezya''da, Kelantan Nehri''nin doğu kıyısında, Tayland sınırı yakınında ve Güney Çin Denizinden 13 km içerisinde yer almaktadır.', 'Kota Bharu, colloquially referred to as KB, is a town in Malaysia that serves as the state capital and royal seat of Kelantan.'),
(1737486, 1737486, 'MY', 'Bintulu', 'Bintulu', 'Bintulu', 'bintulu', 'Sarawak', null, 3.16667, 113.03333, 151617, false, 'Bintulu, Malezya''nin Sarawak eyaletinde yer alan ve Bintulu ilçesinde, Borneo adasında yer alan bir sahil kasabasıdır.', 'Bintulu is a coastal town on the island of Borneo in the central region of Sarawak, Malaysia. Bintulu is located 610 kilometres northeast of Kuching, 216 kilometres northeast of Sibu, and 200 kilometres southwest of Miri.'),
(1738050, 1738050, 'MY', 'Miri', 'Miri', 'Miri', 'miri', 'Sarawak', null, 4.39928, 113.99163, 300543, false, 'Miri, Malezya''nın Sarawak eyaletinde bulunan bir şehirdir. Şehir Borneo Adası''nda, eyaletin kuzeydoğusunda ve Brunei sınırı yakınlarında yer almaktadır.', 'Miri is a coastal city in north-eastern Sarawak, Malaysia, located near the border of Brunei, on the island of Borneo.'),
(1744246, 1744246, 'MY', 'Seri Kembangan', 'Seri Kembangan', 'Seri Kembangan', 'seri kembangan', 'Selangor', null, 3.03333, 101.71667, 130252, false, null, 'Seri Kembangan is a suburb located in Petaling District, Selangor, Malaysia. It is located in between Kuala Lumpur and Putrajaya.'),
(1744763, 1744763, 'MY', 'Sentul', 'Sentul', 'Sentul', 'sentul', 'Kuala Lumpur', null, 3.18333, 101.68333, 100000, false, null, null),
(1749822, 1749822, 'MY', 'Puchong', 'Puchong', 'Puchong', 'puchong', 'Selangor', null, 3, 101.61667, 375181, false, null, null),
