(1848774, 1848774, 'JP', 'Yaizu', 'Yaizu', 'Yaizu', 'yaizu', 'Shizuoka', null, 34.86877, 138.31952, 139578, false, 'Yaizu, Japonya''nın Shizuoka prefektörlüğünde bulunan bir şehirdir. Şehir Suruga Körfezi''nin kıyısında yer almaktadır.', 'Yaizu is a city located in central Shizuoka Prefecture, Japan. As of 31 January 2026, the city had an estimated population of 133,916 in 61,125 households, and a population density of 1,905 persons per km2.'),
