(1873757, 1873757, 'KP', 'Nampo', 'Nampo', 'Namp''o', 'nampo|namp o', 'Nampo', null, 38.7375, 125.40778, 455000, false, 'Nampho, Kuzey Kore''nin Güney Pyongan Eyaletindeki bir liman şehridir. Taedong Nehri''nin kuzeyine kurulmuştur, nehrin başlangıcının 15 km doğusundadır.', 'Nampo, also spelled Namp''o, is a major city in North Korea which is the country''s fourth-largest by population.'),
(1874533, 1874533, 'KP', 'Mangyŏngdae', 'Mangyŏngdae', 'Man''gyongdae-ri', 'mangyongdae|man gyongdae ri', 'Pyongyang', null, 38.99182, 125.65871, 321690, false, null, 'Mangyongdae is a neighborhood in Mangyongdae-guyok, Pyongyang, North Korea. North Korean propaganda claims that Mangyongdae is the birthplace of North Korean leader Kim Il Sung, although in his memoirs he wrote that he had been born in the nearby neighborhood of Chilgol.'),
