(1913126, 1913126, 'CN', 'Nantou Town', 'Nantou Town', 'Nantou', 'nantou town|nantou', 'Guangdong', null, 22.72171, 113.29261, 130370, false, null, 'Nantou is a town situated at the northern periphery of the city of Zhongshan, Guangdong province. The population of Nantou has 130,712 residents.'),
