(1916012, 1916012, 'CN', 'Wuzhishan', 'Wuzhishan City', 'Wuzhishan', 'wuzhishan|wuzhishan city', 'Hainan', null, 18.78229, 109.5013, 112269, false, 'Wuzhishan, Çin''in Hainan eyaletinde bulunan bir şehirdir. Yüzölçümü 1,169 km² olan şehrin nüfusu 2010 yılı itibarı ile 104,119''dur.', 'Wuzhishan is a county-level city in the highlands of Hainan Island, China. Although called a "city", Wuzhishan refers to a large land area in Hainan – an area which was once a county.'),
(1916862, 1916862, 'CN', 'Shijie Town', 'Shijie Town', 'Shijie', 'shijie town|shijie', 'Guangdong', null, 23.09546, 113.79195, 246960, false, null, 'Shijie is a town under the jurisdiction of Dongguan prefecture-level city in Guangdong province, China, located to the north/northeast of downtown.'),
