(3413829, 3413829, 'IS', 'Reykjavík', 'Reykjavík', 'Reykjavik', 'reykjavik', 'Capital Region', null, 64.13548, -21.89541, 118918, true, 'Reykjavik, İzlanda''nın başkenti ve en büyük şehridir. İzlanda''nın güneybatısındaki Faxaflói Körfezi''nin güney kıyısında yer alır ve 64°08′ Kuzey enleminde bulunur; bu da onu dünyanın en kuzeydeki egemen devlet başkenti yapar.', 'Reykjavík is the capital and largest city of Iceland. It is located on the southern shore of the Faxaflói bay in southwest Iceland and has a latitude of 64°08′ N, making it the world''s northernmost capital of a sovereign state.'),
(3421319, 3421319, 'GL', 'Nuuk', 'Nuuk', 'Nuuk', 'nuuk', 'Sermersooq', null, 64.18347, -51.72157, 14798, true, 'Nuuk, Danimarka''ya bağlı özerk bir bölge olan Grönland''ın başkentidir. Nuuk, hem hükûmetin merkezi hem de ülkenin en büyük kültürel ve ekonomik merkezidir.', 'Nuuk is the capital and most populous city of Greenland, an autonomous territory of Denmark. It is the seat of the Sermersooq municipality and the government of Greenland and is the territory''s largest cultural and economic center.'),
(3424934, 3424934, 'PM', 'Saint-Pierre', 'Saint-Pierre', 'Saint-Pierre', 'saint pierre', 'Saint-Pierre', null, 46.77914, -56.1773, 6200, true, 'Saint-Pierre, Fransa Denizaşırı Bölgeler Topluluğu bölgelerinde biri olan Fransa''ya bağlı olan Saint Pierre ve Miquelon''da bir liman kenti ve bölgenin en büyük yerleşimi ve merkezidir.', 'Saint-Pierre is the capital of the French collectivité d''outre-mer of Saint Pierre and Miquelon, off the coast of the Canadian island of Newfoundland.'),
(3426466, 3426466, 'GS', 'Grytviken', 'Grytviken', 'Grytviken', 'grytviken', null, null, -54.28111, -36.5092, 2, true, null, 'Grytviken is a hamlet on South Georgia in the South Atlantic. Formerly a whaling station, it was the largest settlement on the island.'),
(3426691, 3426691, 'FK', 'Stanley', 'Stanley', 'Stanley', 'stanley', null, null, -51.69382, -57.85701, 2213, true, 'Stanley veya Port Stanley, Güney Amerika''daki ve Atlas Okyanusu''nun güneyindeki bir Britanya Denizaşırı Toprakları olarak Birleşik Krallık''a bağlı olan Falkland Adaları''nın başkentidir.', 'Stanley is the capital city of the Falkland Islands. It is located on the island of East Falkland, on a north-facing slope in one of the wettest parts of the islands.'),
(3427833, 3427833, 'AR', 'Tandil', 'Tandil', 'Tandil', 'tandil', 'Buenos Aires', null, -37.3287, -59.1369, 115877, false, null, 'Tandil is the main city of the homonymous partido, located in Argentina, in the southeast of Buenos Aires Province, just north-northwest of Tandilia hills.'),
(3428775, 3428775, 'AR', 'San Justo', 'San Justo', 'San Justo', 'san justo', 'Buenos Aires', null, -34.68107, -58.56379, 105274, false, null, 'San Justo is a city and the seat of government of La Matanza Partido, Buenos Aires Province, Argentina.'),
(3429577, 3429577, 'AR', 'Resistencia', 'Resistencia', 'Resistencia', 'resistencia', 'Chaco', null, -27.46363, -58.98665, 290793, false, 'Resistencia, Arjantin''in kuzeydoğusunda, Chaco eyaletinin merkezi olan şehirdir.', 'Resistencia is the capital and largest city of the province of Chaco in north-eastern Argentina. According to the 2010 census, the population of the city proper was 291,720 inhabitants.'),
(3429652, 3429652, 'AR', 'Quilmes', 'Quilmes', 'Quilmes', 'quilmes', 'Buenos Aires', null, -34.72065, -58.25454, 262379, false, 'Quilmes, Arjantin''in Buenos Aires eyaletinde yer alan bir şehirdir. Başkent Buenos Aires''in 17 km güneyinde yer almaktadır.', 'Quilmes is a city on the coast of the Rio de la Plata, in the province of Buenos Aires, Argentina, on the southeast end of the Greater Buenos Aires, being some 17 km away from the urban centre area of Buenos Aires.'),
(3429886, 3429886, 'AR', 'Posadas', 'Posadas', 'Posadas', 'posadas', 'Misiones', null, -27.39184, -55.92379, 305874, false, 'Posadas Arjantin''in Misiones eyaletinin başkenti olan şehirdir.', 'Posadas is the capital city of the Argentine province of Misiones, in its south, at the far northeast of the country on the left bank of the Paraná River, opposite Encarnación, Paraguay.'),
(3430697, 3430697, 'AR', 'Merlo', 'Merlo', 'Merlo', 'merlo', 'Buenos Aires', null, -34.66536, -58.72744, 268961, false, 'Merlo, Arjantin''in Buenos Aires eyaletinde yer alan bir şehirdir. Şehrin toplam nüfusu 244.168''tir.', 'Merlo is the head city of the eponymous partido of Merlo and seat of the municipal government, located in the Greater Buenos Aires urban area of Buenos Aires Province, Argentina.'),
(3430863, 3430863, 'AR', 'Mar del Plata', 'Mar del Plata', 'Mar del Plata', 'mar del plata', 'Buenos Aires', null, -38.00042, -57.5562, 593337, false, 'Mar del Plata, Arjantin''in Buenos Aires eyaletinde yer alan bir şehirdir. Bu şehir Atlas Okyanusu kıyısında yer almaktadır.', 'Mar del Plata is a city of the Atlantic Coast, in Buenos Aires Province, Argentina. It is the seat of General Pueyrredón district.'),
(3431271, 3431271, 'AR', 'Lomas de Zamora', 'Lomas de Zamora', 'Lomas de Zamora', 'lomas de zamora', 'Buenos Aires', null, -34.7574, -58.40279, 111897, false, 'Lomas de Zamora, Arjantin''in Buenos Aires eyaletinde yer alan bir şehirdir. Şehrin toplam nüfusu 111.897''dir.', 'Lomas de Zamora is a city in the province of Buenos Aires, Argentina, located south of the City of Buenos Aires and within the metropolitan area of Greater Buenos Aires.'),
(3432043, 3432043, 'AR', 'La Plata', 'La Plata', 'La Plata', 'la plata', 'Buenos Aires', null, -34.92126, -57.95442, 195443, false, 'La Plata Arjantin''de başkent Buenos Aires''in güneyinde, Buenos Aires ilinin merkezi şehir. Buenos Aires şehri 1880 yılında Federal Bölge ilan edildikten sonra, La Plata, Buenos Aires ilinin merkezi olarak planlanmıştır.', 'La Plata is the capital and largest city of Buenos Aires province, Argentina. According to the 2022 census, the Partido has a population of 772,618 and its metropolitan area, Greater La Plata, has 938,287 inhabitants.'),
(3432135, 3432135, 'AR', 'Lanús', 'Lanús', 'Lanus', 'lanus', 'Buenos Aires', null, -34.70757, -58.39132, 212252, false, 'Lanus, Arjantin''in Buenos Aires eyaletinde yer alan bir şehirdir. Şehrin toplam nüfusu 212.152''dir.', 'Lanús is the capital of Lanús Partido, Buenos Aires Province in Argentina. It lies just south of the capital city Buenos Aires, in the Greater Buenos Aires metropolitan area.'),
(3432555, 3432555, 'AR', 'Gregorio de Laferrere', 'Gregorio de Laferrere', 'Laferrere', 'gregorio de laferrere|laferrere', 'Buenos Aires', null, -34.75049, -58.58464, 248362, false, null, 'Gregorio de Laferrère is a city in the La Matanza Partido of Buenos Aires Province.'),
(3433360, 3433360, 'AR', 'Ituzaingó', 'Ituzaingó', 'Ituzaingo', 'ituzaingo', 'Corrientes', null, -27.58504, -56.68707, 168419, false, null, 'Ituzaingó is a city in Corrientes Province, Argentina, at the Argentina–Paraguay border.'),
(3433424, 3433424, 'AR', 'Isıdro Casanova', 'Isidro Casanova', 'Isidro Casanova', 'isidro casanova', 'Buenos Aires', null, -34.7, -58.58745, 131981, false, 'Isidro Casanova, Arjantin''in Buenos Aires eyaletine bağlı La Matanza bucağında bulunan bir şehir ve belediyedir.', 'Isidro Casanova is a city in La Matanza Partido, Greater Buenos Aires, Argentina. It borders the towns of Villa Luzuriaga, San Justo, Ciudad Evita, Rafael Castillo, Laferrere, and Ezeiza.'),
(3433899, 3433899, 'AR', 'Formosa', 'Formosa', 'Formosa', 'formosa', 'Formosa', null, -26.18489, -58.17313, 222226, false, null, 'Formosa is the capital city of the Argentine province of Formosa, on the banks of the Paraguay River, opposite the Paraguayan town of Alberdi, about 1,200 km north from Buenos Aires, on National Route 11.'),
(3433975, 3433975, 'AR', 'Ezeiza', 'Ezeiza', 'Ezeiza', 'ezeiza', 'Buenos Aires', null, -34.8544, -58.52474, 115021, false, 'Ezeiza, Arjantin''in Buenos Aires eyaletinde yer alan bir şehirdir. Şehrin toplam nüfusu 160.219''dur.', 'Ezeiza is the capital city of the Ezeiza Partido within the Greater Buenos Aires area in Argentina. The city had a population of 160,219 in 2010.'),
(3435217, 3435217, 'AR', 'Corrientes', 'Corrientes', 'Corrientes', 'corrientes', 'Corrientes', null, -27.46784, -58.8344, 346334, false, null, 'Corrientes is the capital city of the province of Corrientes, Argentina, on the eastern shore of the Paraná River, about 1,000 km from Buenos Aires and 300 km from Posadas, on National Route 12.'),
(3435261, 3435261, 'AR', 'Concordia', 'Concordia', 'Concordia', 'concordia', 'Entre Rios', null, -31.39195, -58.01706, 145210, false, null, 'Concordia, officially San Antonio de Padua de la Concordia, is a city and municipality that is the head town of the Concordia department, Entre Ríos Province, located in the Argentine Mesopotamia.'),
(3435607, 3435607, 'AR', 'Castelar', 'Castelar', 'Castelar', 'castelar', 'Buenos Aires', null, -34.65142, -58.64074, 107786, false, 'Castelar, Arjantin''in Buenos Aires eyaletinde yer alan bir şehirdir. Şehrin toplam nüfusu 104.019''dur.', 'Castelar is a city in Morón Partido, Buenos Aires Province, Argentina, some 30 km west of the nation''s capital, the autonomous city of Buenos Aires.'),
(3435910, 3435910, 'AR', 'Buenos Aires', 'Buenos Aires', 'Buenos Aires', 'buenos aires', 'Buenos Aires F.D.', null, -34.61315, -58.37723, 2891082, true, 'Buenos Aires, resmî adıyla Buenos Aires Özerk Şehri, Arjantin''in başkenti ve en büyük şehridir. "Güney yarımkürenin Paris''i" olarak anılan şehir, Río de la Plata''nın güneybatı kıyısında yer almaktadır.', 'Buenos Aires, officially the Autonomous City of Buenos Aires, is the capital and largest city of Argentina. It is located on the southwest of the Río de la Plata.'),
(3436043, 3436043, 'AR', 'Berazategui', 'Berazategui', 'Berazategui', 'berazategui', 'Buenos Aires', null, -34.76531, -58.21278, 180523, false, null, 'Berazategui is a city in Buenos Aires Province, Argentina. It is the head town of the Berazategui Partido and is part of the Greater Buenos Aires metropolitan area.'),
(3437056, 3437056, 'PY', 'San Lorenzo', 'San Lorenzo', 'San Lorenzo', 'san lorenzo', 'Central Department', null, -25.33968, -57.50879, 227876, false, 'San Lorenzo, Paraguay''ın Orta Departmanında bulunan bir şehirdir. Paraguay''ın 4. büyük şehridir.', 'San Lorenzo is a city in the Central Department in Paraguay. It is a suburb of Asunción, and the third most populous city in Paraguay, with a population of 252,561.'),
(3437863, 3437863, 'PY', 'Lambare', 'Lambaré', 'Lambare', 'lambare', 'Central Department', null, -25.34682, -57.60647, 126377, false, 'Lambaré Paraguay''ın Central ilinin bir ilçesidir.', 'Lambaré is a city in Central Department, Paraguay, forming part of the Greater Asuncion metropolitan area. It covers an area of 27 km2 and had a population of 127,150 inhabitants according to the 2022 national census, making it the eighth-most populous city in the country.'),
(3438115, 3438115, 'PY', 'Fernando de la Mora', 'Fernando de la Mora', 'Fernando de la Mora', 'fernando de la mora', 'Central Department', null, -25.3386, -57.52167, 120167, false, 'Fernando de la Mora Paraguay''ın Central ilinin bir ilçesidir.', 'Fernando de la Mora is a city located in the Central Department, and is part of the metropolitan area of Asunción, Paraguay.'),
(3439101, 3439101, 'PY', 'Ciudad del Este', 'Ciudad del Este', 'Ciudad del Este', 'ciudad del este', 'Alto Paraná Department', null, -25.5036, -54.65067, 301815, false, 'Ciudad del Este, Paraguay''ın Alto Paraná bölümünün başkentidir. 2008 itibarıyla 320.000''den fazla nüfusuyla ülkenin en kalabalık ikinci şehridir.', 'Ciudad del Este is the second-largest city in Paraguay and capital of the Alto Paraná Department, situated on the Paraná River.'),
(3439214, 3439214, 'PY', 'Capiata', 'Capiatá', 'Capiata', 'capiata', 'Central Department', null, -25.3552, -57.44545, 198553, false, 'Capiatá, Paraguay''ın Central ilinin bir ilçesidir.', 'Capiatá is a city and a district in Central Department, Paraguay. It had a population of 236,999 inhabitants according to the 2022 national census, making it the fourth-most populous city in the country.'),
(3439389, 3439389, 'PY', 'Asunción', 'Asunción', 'Asuncion', 'asuncion', 'Asuncion', null, -25.28646, -57.647, 1482200, true, 'Asunción, Paraguay''ın başkentidir. Aynı zamanda en büyük limanı ve endüstri ile kültürel yönden de en önemli kentidir.', 'Asunción is the capital and the largest city of Paraguay. The city lies on the eastern bank of the Paraguay River, immediately north northeast of the confluence where it is joined by the Pilcomayo River.'),
(3440714, 3440714, 'UY', 'Salto', 'Salto', 'Salto', 'salto', 'Salto Department', null, -31.38811, -57.95983, 114084, false, 'Salto, Uruguay''ın Salto departmantımın başkenti olan şehirdir. Uruguay''ın ikinci en büyük şehir olan Salto''nun toplam nüfusu 2010 yılı itibarıyla 212.152''dir.', 'Salto is a city in and the capital of the Salto Department in northwestern Uruguay. As of the 2023 census it had a population of 114,084 and is the second most populated city in Uruguay, after Montevideo.'),
(3441575, 3441575, 'UY', 'Montevideo', 'Montevideo', 'Montevideo', 'montevideo', 'Montevideo Department', null, -34.90328, -56.18816, 1270737, true, 'Montevideo, Uruguay''ın başkenti ve en büyük şehridir. 2023 nüfus sayımına göre şehrin nüfusu 1.302.954''tür ve alanı 201 kilometrekaredir.', 'Montevideo is the capital and largest city of Uruguay. As of the 2023 census, the city proper has a population of 1,287,452, making up about 36.8% of the country''s total population, in an area of 201 square kilometers.'),
(3441894, 3441894, 'UY', 'Maldonado', 'Maldonado', 'Maldonado', 'maldonado', 'Maldonado', null, -34.89791, -54.95021, 102000, false, null, 'Maldonado is the capital city of Maldonado Department, in eastern Uruguay. According to the 2023 Census, it is the fourth most populated city in the country, with about 102 thousand inhabitants.'),
