(3488465, 3488465, 'JM', 'Spanish Town', 'Spanish Town', 'Spanish Town', 'spanish town', 'Saint Catherine Parish', null, 17.99107, -76.95742, 145018, false, 'Spanish Town, Jamaika''nın Saint Catherine bucağında bulunan bir şehirdir. 1534-1872 yılları arasında, İngiliz kolonisi statüsündeki Jamaika''nın başkentiydi.', 'Spanish Town is the capital and the largest town in the parish of St. Catherine in the historic county of Middlesex, Jamaica.'),
(3488981, 3488981, 'JM', 'Portmore', 'Portmore', 'Portmore', 'portmore', 'Saint Catherine Parish', null, 17.97102, -76.88691, 102861, false, null, 'Portmore is a city in southeastern Jamaica, located in the parish of St Catherine. It primarily serves as a commuter town for the capital city of Kingston.'),
(3489854, 3489854, 'JM', 'Kingston', 'Kingston', 'Kingston', 'kingston', 'Kingston', null, 17.99702, -76.79358, 937700, true, 'Kingston, Antiller''de bulunan ada ülkesi Jamaika''nın başkenti ve en önemli limanıdır. Aynı zamanda tüm Batı Hint Adaları''nın en büyük ticaret merkezidir.', 'Kingston is the capital and largest city of Jamaica, located on the southeastern coast of the island. It faces a natural harbour protected by the Palisadoes, a long sand spit which connects the town of Port Royal and Norman Manley International Airport to the rest of the island.'),
(3492908, 3492908, 'DO', 'Santo Domingo', 'Santo Domingo', 'Santo Domingo', 'santo domingo', 'Nacional', null, 18.47186, -69.89232, 2201941, true, 'Santo Domingo, Dominik Cumhuriyeti''nin başkenti. Avrupalıların Batı Yarıküre''de kurdukları en eski sürekli yerleşmedir.', 'Santo Domingo, officially known as Santo Domingo de Guzmán, is the capital and largest city of the Dominican Republic and the largest metropolitan area in the Caribbean by population.'),
