(3523149, 3523149, 'MX', 'Miramar', 'Miramar', 'Miramar', 'miramar', 'Tamaulipas', null, 22.36094, -97.89997, 118614, false, null, 'Miramar is a city near the southeastern tip of the state of Tamaulipas in Mexico. It is the largest city in the municipality of Altamira and third largest of the Tampico Metropolitan Area.'),
