(3573374, 3573374, 'AI', 'The Valley', 'The Valley', 'The Valley', 'the valley', 'The Valley', null, 18.21704, -63.05783, 2035, true, 'The Valley, Anguilla''nın başkenti ve adanın tek şehridir. Yaklaşık 1.400 kişilik nüfusa sahiptir.', 'The Valley is the capital of Anguilla, one of its fourteen districts, and the main town on the island. As of 2011, it had a population of 3,269.'),
(3573890, 3573890, 'TT', 'Port of Spain', 'Port of Spain', 'Port of Spain', 'port of spain', 'Port of Spain', null, 10.66668, -61.51889, 49031, true, 'Port of Spain ya da resmî kullanımıyla City of Port of Spain, Karayipler ada ülkesi Trinidad ve Tobago''nun başkentidir.', 'Port of Spain is the capital and chief port of Trinidad and Tobago. With a municipal population of 49,867, an urban population of 81,142 and a transient daily population of 250,000, it is Trinidad and Tobago''s third largest municipality, after Chaguanas and San Fernando.'),
(3575551, 3575551, 'KN', 'Basseterre', 'Basseterre', 'Basseterre', 'basseterre', 'Saint George Basseterre', null, 17.2955, -62.72499, 12920, true, 'Basseterre, Karayipler''de Küçük Antiller''in bir parçası konumunda olan ve coğrafî açıdan Orta Amerika''ya dâhil edilen ada ülkesi Saint Kitts ve Nevis''in başkentidir.', 'Basseterre is the capital and largest city of Saint Kitts and Nevis with an estimated population of 14,000 in 2018.'),
(3575635, 3575635, 'DM', 'Roseau', 'Roseau', 'Roseau', 'roseau', 'Saint George Parish', null, 15.30174, -61.38808, 16571, true, 'Roseau, Dominika''nın başkenti ve en büyük şehridir.', 'Roseau is the capital and largest city of Dominica, with a population of 14,725 as of 2011. It is a small and compact urban settlement, in the Saint George parish and surrounded by the Caribbean Sea, the Roseau River and Morne Bruce.'),
(3576022, 3576022, 'AG', 'Saint John’s', 'Saint John’s', 'Saint John''s', 'saint john s', 'Saint John Parish', null, 17.12096, -61.84329, 51737, true, 'St. John''s, Antigua ve Barbuda''nın başkenti ve en kalabalık şehridir.', 'St. John''s is the largest city in Antigua and Barbuda.'),
(3576812, 3576812, 'LC', 'Castries', 'Castries', 'Castries', 'castries', 'Castries', null, 13.9957, -61.00614, 20000, true, 'Castries, 61.704 kişilik nüfusa sahip olup Saint Lucia''nın başkentidir. Batı Karayiplerde bulunur.', 'Castries is the capital and largest city of Saint Lucia, an island country in the Caribbean. The urban area has a population of approximately 20,000, while the eponymous district has a population of just under 70,000, as of May 2013.'),
(3576994, 3576994, 'TC', 'Cockburn Town', 'Cockburn Town', 'Cockburn Town', 'cockburn town', null, null, 21.46122, -71.14188, 3720, true, 'Cockburn Town, Britanya Denizaşırı Toprakları olan Turks ve Caicos Adaları''nın başkentidir. Turks Adalarının en büyük adasıdır.', 'Cockburn Town is the capital of the Turks and Caicos Islands, spreading across most of Grand Turk. It was founded in 1681 by salt collectors.'),
(3577154, 3577154, 'AW', 'Oranjestad', 'Oranjestad', 'Oranjestad', 'oranjestad', null, null, 12.52398, -70.02703, 29998, true, 'Oranjestad, Hollanda Krallığı''na ait olan Aruba adasının başkentidir. 2005 itibarıyla 30.000 kişilik nüfusu ile de adanın en büyük şehridir.', 'Oranjestad, the capital and most populous of Aruba''s eight regions, is located on the southwestern coast of the island.'),
(3577430, 3577430, 'VG', 'Road Town', 'Road Town', 'Road Town', 'road town', null, null, 18.42693, -64.62079, 8449, true, 'Road Town, Karayipler''de bir İngiliz kolonisi olan İngiliz Virjin Adaları''nın başkentidir. Aynı zamanda ülkenin en büyük kentidir.', 'Road Town, located on Tortola, is the capital and largest town of the British Virgin Islands. It is situated on the horseshoe-shaped Road Harbour in the centre of the island''s south coast.'),
(3577887, 3577887, 'VC', 'Kingstown', 'Kingstown', 'Kingstown', 'kingstown', 'Saint George Parish', null, 13.15527, -61.22742, 24518, true, 'Kingstown, Karayipler''deki ada devletlerinden biri olan Saint Vincent ve Grenadinler''in başkentidir. 2006 itibarıyla şehirde 18.200 kişi yaşamaktadır.', 'Kingstown is the capital and largest city of Saint Vincent and the Grenadines. The city, located on the main island of Saint Vincent, has the main port and the biggest commercial center of the islands.'),
(3578069, 3578069, 'MS', 'Plymouth', 'Plymouth', 'Plymouth', 'plymouth', 'Saint Anthony', null, 16.70555, -62.21292, 0, true, 'Plymouth, Kuzey Amerika''da Karayipler''in Antiller bölgesinde Britanya Denizaşırı Toprakları bölgesi olarak Birleşik Krallık''a bağlı bir ada olan Montserrat''tın yasal başkentidir.', 'Plymouth is a ghost town and the de jure capital of the island of Montserrat, an overseas territory of the United Kingdom located in the Leeward Island chain of the Lesser Antilles, West Indies.'),
(3578851, 3578851, 'MF', 'Marigot', 'Marigot', 'Marigot', 'marigot', null, null, 18.06819, -63.08302, 5700, true, 'Marigot, Karayipler''deki Saint Martin adasının Fransız kesimindeki ana kasaba ve merkezidir. 2006 itibarıyla 5.700 kişilik nüfusu vardır.', 'Marigot is the main town and capital in the French Collectivity of Saint Martin. The area has been inhabited since the 17th century and fortifications were erected in 1789.'),
(3579132, 3579132, 'BL', 'Gustavia', 'Gustavia', 'Gustavia', 'gustavia', null, null, 17.89618, -62.84978, 5988, true, 'Gustavia, doğu Karayipler''deki Fransız denizaşırı topraklarından biri olan Saint Barthélemy''nin merkezi ve tek büyük yerleşimidir.', 'Gustavia is the main town and capital of the island of Saint Barthélemy. Originally called Le Carénage, it was renamed in honor of King Gustav III of Sweden.'),
(3579732, 3579732, 'GP', 'Basse-Terre', 'Basse-Terre', 'Basse-Terre', 'basse terre', 'Guadeloupe', null, 15.99714, -61.73214, 11472, true, 'Basse-Terre, Fransa''nın denizaşırı départementlarından biri olan Guadeloupe''un başkentidir. 1999 itibarıyla asıl şehir 12.152 kişilik nüfusa sahiptir; aglomerasyon ise 44.864. ve Soufrière yanardağın dibinde, Rivière aux Herbes''in ağzında, aynı adı taşıyan Basse-Terre Adasının güneybatısında bulunur.', 'Basse-Terre is a commune in the French overseas department of Guadeloupe, in the Lesser Antilles. It is also the prefecture of Guadeloupe.'),
(3579925, 3579925, 'GD', 'Saint George''s', 'St. George''s', 'Saint George''s', 'saint george s|st george s', 'Saint George Parish', null, 12.05288, -61.75226, 7500, true, 'St. George''s, nüfusu 7.500 33,000 kişinin toplanmasıyla birlikte Grenada''nın başkentidir.', 'St. George''s is the capital and largest city of Grenada.'),
(3580661, 3580661, 'KY', 'George Town', 'George Town', 'George Town', 'george town', 'George Town', null, 19.2866, -81.37436, 29370, true, 'George Town, Karayipler''de bir İngiliz Kolonisi olan Cayman Adaları''nın başkentidir. Büyük Cayman adasında bulunur.', 'George Town is the capital and largest city in the Cayman Islands, located on Grand Cayman. It was named after King George III.'),
(3582672, 3582672, 'BZ', 'Belmopán', 'Belmopan', 'Belmopan', 'belmopan', 'Cayo District', null, 17.25376, -88.76401, 13381, true, 'Belmopán, Belize''nin başkentidir. Orta Amerika''da yaklaşık nüfusu 20.000 olan Belmopán deniz seviyesinden 76 metre yüksekte 17°15′K, 88°45′B koordinatlarında yer alır.', 'Belmopan is the capital city of Belize. Its population in 2022 was 20,754.'),
(3583096, 3583096, 'SV', 'Soyapango', 'Soyapango', 'Soyapango', 'soyapango', 'San Salvador Department', null, 13.71024, -89.13989, 329708, false, null, 'Soyapango is a district in the San Salvador department of El Salvador. Soyapango is the country''s largest municipality with 284,700 residents.'),
(3583334, 3583334, 'SV', 'Santa Ana', 'Santa Ana', 'Santa Ana', 'santa ana', 'Santa Ana Department', null, 13.98827, -89.55685, 176661, false, 'Santa Ana, El Salvador''un başkenti olan San Salvador''dan sonra ülkenin ikinci büyük şehridir. Başkent San Salvador''un 64 kilometre kuzeybatısında yer alır.', 'Santa Ana is the second largest city in El Salvador, after the capital of San Salvador. It is located 64 kilometers northwest of San Salvador, the capital city.'),
(3583361, 3583361, 'SV', 'San Salvador', 'San Salvador', 'San Salvador', 'san salvador', 'San Salvador Department', null, 13.68935, -89.18718, 525990, true, 'San Salvador, El Salvador''un başkenti ve en büyük şehri olan San Salvador, aynı adı taşıyan departmanın da merkezidir.', 'San Salvador is the capital and largest city of El Salvador and of its eponymous department. It is the country''s largest agglomeration, serving as the country''s political, cultural, educational and financial center.'),
(3583446, 3583446, 'SV', 'San Miguel', 'San Miguel', 'San Miguel', 'san miguel', 'San Miguel Department', null, 13.48261, -88.18211, 247126, false, null, 'San Miguel is a city in eastern El Salvador. It is the country''s third most populous city.'),
(3584257, 3584257, 'SV', 'Santa Tecla', 'Santa Tecla', 'Santa Tecla', 'santa tecla', 'La Libertad Department', null, 13.67741, -89.28335, 124694, false, null, 'Santa Tecla, formerly known as Nueva San Salvador, is a city and a municipality in the La Libertad department of El Salvador.'),
(3584399, 3584399, 'SV', 'Mejicanos', 'Mejicanos', 'Mejicanos', 'mejicanos', 'San Salvador Department', null, 13.72397, -89.188, 160317, false, null, 'Mejicanos is a district of San Salvador Centro municipality in the San Salvador department of El Salvador.'),
(3587345, 3587345, 'SV', 'Apopa', 'Apopa', 'Apopa', 'apopa', 'San Salvador Department', null, 13.80722, -89.17917, 112158, false, null, 'Apopa is a district in the San Salvador department of El Salvador. Probably the seventh biggest city in El Salvador with a little more than 150,000 people, the city has now collided with Soyapango and San Salvador, making it part of the San Salvador metropolitan area.'),
