(5389489, 5389489, 'US', 'Sacramento', 'Sacramento', 'Sacramento', 'sacramento', 'California', null, 38.58157, -121.4944, 524943, false, 'Sacramento, Amerika Birleşik Devletleri''nin Kaliforniya eyaletinin başkenti ve Sacramento Kontluk veya Sacramento County ilçe merkezi.', 'Sacramento is the capital city of the U.S. state of California. The county seat of Sacramento County, it is located at the confluence of the Sacramento and American Rivers in the Sacramento Valley.'),
