(6653052, 6653052, 'IR', 'Sadra', 'Sadra', 'Shahr-e Sadra', 'sadra|shahr e sadra', 'Fars', null, 29.79972, 52.50215, 122226, false, null, 'Sadra is a planned city in the Central District of Shiraz County, Fars province, Iran. With a population of 122,226, Sadra is the fourth most populous city of the province. it is located 15 kilometres northwest of Shiraz, in “Ahu-char Plain”, which is more than 300 metres higher than Shiraz.'),
