(6681051, 6681051, 'IR', 'Perdis', 'Pardis', 'Pardis', 'perdis|pardis', 'Tehran', null, 35.74687, 51.81222, 114249, false, 'Perdis, İran''ın Tahran Eyaleti''nde şehir.', 'Pardis is a city in the Central District of Pardis County, Tehran province, Iran, serving as capital of both the county and the district.'),
